    14	// It goes through the real 'context build' rather than writing the event by hand. The gate
    15	// recomputes the skill digests from the cognitive layer and compares them, so a hand-written
    16	// digest would be refused as stale. That refusal would be the check working; going through the
    17	// production path is what makes the staged brief a current one.
